    "mcp-guide-5": {
      "id": "mcp-guide-5",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "Component manifests declare selection guidance and examples. The shared authoring-guidance renderer supplies the catalog to external tools and both built-in Docs agent contexts. "
        },
        {
          "insert": "docs_begin",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " lists one-line component purposes. "
        },
        {
          "insert": "docs_guidance",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " topic "
        },
        {
          "insert": "components",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " returns the full catalog, and its "
        },
        {
          "insert": "component",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " argument returns one component's canonical reference."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "mcp-guide-6": {
      "id": "mcp-guide-6",
      "type": "heading",
      "props": {
        "level": 2
      },
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "Shared Service"
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "mcp-guide-7": {
      "id": "mcp-guide-7",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "With the signed background app installed, the CLI connects to the central host on port 4820. Browser and MCP operations use the same active runtime. Project IDs select registered corpora. Without the background installation, the standalone daemon remains available."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "mcp-guide-8": {
      "id": "mcp-guide-8",
      "type": "heading",
      "props": {
        "level": 2
      },
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "Development Setup"
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "mcp-guide-9": {
      "id": "mcp-guide-9",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "From the Docs System repository, run bun packages/docs-mcp/src/cli.ts install to preview the client configuration and skill files. Add --write to install with backups. Run doctor to check those installed files. Restart the coding clients or reload pi after installation."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "mcp-guide-10": {
      "id": "mcp-guide-10",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "Use the ui command with a workspace and project ID to inspect edits through the shared workbench. Publication remains separate: the same corpus can be exported or embedded in a website without deploying after every edit."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "mcp-guide-11": {
      "id": "mcp-guide-11",
      "type": "heading",
      "props": {
        "level": 2
      },
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "Source Ownership"
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
